[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756977327","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114996#issuecomment-3756977327","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114996","id":3756977327,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f7uyv","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T21:33:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T21:33:50Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.6.beta 1910c58c4 (Linux), so this isn't Windows-specific.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756977327/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3757428802","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114996#issuecomment-3757428802","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114996","id":3757428802,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f9dBC","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T23:59:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T00:26:51Z","body":"I think I've figured it out.\nDespite [issue #88006](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/88006) being closed, it's clear that 0.0 is being displayed instead of `NaN`. This happens because while [PR #105911](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105911) allowed non-finite values, it missed handling them properly. As a result, the `_snapped_r128` function called in `Range::set_value()` returns 0 anyway when encountering them. After adding a proper `NaN` check, everything displays correctly.\n\nBy the way, `INF` values are displayed correctly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3757428802/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3781339647","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114996#issuecomment-3781339647","issue_u